## Code Review Checklist

Before submitting PR, verify:

- [ ] TypeScript compiles without errors
- [ ] ESLint passes with no warnings
- [ ] Tests are written and passing
- [ ] Feature code is in correct feature folder
- [ ] No cross-feature imports
- [ ] Shared code in shared folders
- [ ] Permissions are checked in services
- [ ] Data is scoped to organization/property
- [ ] Loading and error states handled
- [ ] User-friendly error messages
- [ ] No console.logs in production code
- [ ] Accessibility requirements met
- [ ] Documentation updated if needed
- [ ] No hardcoded values (use constants)
- [ ] Follows existing code patterns

## Moving Code to Shared

When code is used by 2+ features, move it to shared:

```bash
# Component used by multiple features?
# Move from:  src/features/bookings/components/StatusBadge.tsx
# Move to:    src/components/shared/StatusBadge.tsx

# Hook used by multiple features?
# Move from:  src/features/bookings/hooks/use-filters.ts
# Move to:    src/hooks/use-filters.ts

# Utility used by multiple features?
# Move from:  src/features/bookings/utils/format-date.ts
# Move to:    src/utils/format-date.ts
```

## Deployment

### Environments

| Environment | Branch      | URL            |
| ----------- | ----------- | -------------- |
| Development | -           | localhost:3004 |
| Preview     | PR branches | \*.vercel.app  |
| Production  | main        | app.domain.com |

### Deployment Process

```
1. PR merged to main
2. CI runs tests
3. Build succeeds
4. Auto-deploy to preview
5. Manual approval
6. Deploy to production
7. Monitor for issues
```

### Rollback

```bash
# Vercel CLI
vercel rollback

# Or via dashboard
# Go to Vercel > Deployments > Previous > Redeploy
```

## Debugging

### Database Issues

```bash
# Open Drizzle Studio
bun run db:studio

# Check connection
bun run db:push --verbose
```

### API Issues

```typescript
// Enable tRPC logging
// apps/web/src/server/trpc.ts
const t = initTRPC.context<Context>().create({
  // ...
  isDev: process.env.NODE_ENV === 'development',
});
```

### Component Issues

```typescript
// Use React DevTools
// TanStack Query DevTools
import { ReactQueryDevtools } from '@tanstack/react-query-devtools';

// In providers
